<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,401 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,401 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,401 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX). Dealers said the central bank sold $0.66 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Sept 26		 Sept 25</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,401		   5,401</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	4.45		    4.59</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
